---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---
<section class="section access" id="access">
  <div class="inner">
    <h2 class="access-title">アクセス</h2>

    <div class="access-intro" data-reveal>
      <p class="access-intro-text">自然に囲まれた山あいの静かな立地です。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="access-content">

      <div class="access-info" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 80ms">
        <dl class="access-list">
          <div class="access-item">
            <dt class="access-item-label">
              <Icon name="mdi:train" class="access-item-icon" />
              電車でお越しの方
            </dt>
            <dd class="access-item-text">
              〇〇駅より路線バスで約40分<br />
              「静寂庵前」下車 徒歩5分<br />
              <span class="access-item-note">※ご到着時に送迎もあります。</span>
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div class="access-item">
            <dt class="access-item-label">
              <Icon name="mdi:car" class="access-item-icon" />
              お車でお越しの方
            </dt>
            <dd class="access-item-text">
              〇〇ICより約35分（無料駐車場あり）<br />
              カーナビは「静寂庵」で検索ください。
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div class="access-item">
            <dt class="access-item-label">
              <Icon name="mdi:bus" class="access-item-icon" />
              送迎について
            </dt>
            <dd class="access-item-text">
              最寄り駅からの送迎を承っております。<br />
              前日までにご予約をお願いいたします。
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <!-- Googleマップ埋め込み -->
      <div class="access-map" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 160ms">
        <iframe
          src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=YOUR_EMBED_URL"
          width="400"
          height="300"
          style="border:0;"
          allowfullscreen=""
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
          title="静寂庵の地図"
        ></iframe>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use '../../styles/variables' as *;
  @use '../../styles/mixins' as *;

  /* access-title */
  .access-title {
    @include section-title;
    text-align: center;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  /* access-intro */
  .access-intro {
    margin-top: 16px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .access-intro-text {
    font-size: $size-sm;
    color: $color-text-light;
  }

  /* access-content */
  .access-content {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-top: 40px;

    @include tablet {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 32px;
    }
  }

  /* ── 左: アクセス情報 ── */
  .access-info {
    max-width: 360px;
  }

  .access-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .access-item-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: $size-base;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: $color-primary;
  }

  .access-item-icon {
    width: 1.25rem;
    height: 1.25rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: $color-accent;
  }

  .access-item-text {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: $size-sm;
    line-height: 1.8;
    padding-left: 28px; // アイコン幅 + gap 分のインデント
  }

  .access-item-note {
    font-size: $size-xs;
    color: $color-text-light;
  }

  /* ── 右: Googleマップ ── */
  .access-map {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 400px;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 4px;

    iframe {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      display: block;
    }

    @include tablet {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 400px;
    }
  }
</style>